    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really strong start. it definitely has that epic feel. i'm a bit worried though, some people might say it's a bit one-sided since it doesn't mention the impact on the tribes who were already there. do you think we should add a section acknowledging the conflict or should we just keep the focus on the progress side to maintain the exhibit's theme?",
